title: Francheesqua_Introduction
Francheesqua: Hey baby how you doi- damn you dont look so hot.
Renatto: No no, I'm fine really.
Francheesqua: God Renatto..... I fuckin' told you to stop using so much. You look terrible.
Renatto: It's not that.
Francheesqua: What do you mean its NOT that. Whats wrong then?
Renatto: They found out..
Francheesqua: What? Who?
Renatto: They noticed I was using their supply.
Francheesqua: You said you stopped doing that shit
Renatto: I know
Francheesqua: How fucked are we.
Renatto: 50,000 cheds
Francheesqua: Oh thats not to bad. Im sure in a few months you can pay them back with interest.
Renatto: I don't have a few months. They gave me two weeks.
...
...
...
Francheesqua: TWO WEEKS?!?
Francheesqua: What are you doing to do?
Renatto: I dont know.
Francheesqua: You're not gonna cook again are you.
Renatto: I have no choice.
Renatto: I have to pay them back. This is the only way.
Renatto: If I don't who knows what will happen to you? What will happen to Tommy. To his wife? To his kids?
Renatto: I can't let them hurt you guys.
Francheesqua: Okay...
Francheesqua: What do you need.
Renatto: I have to go find my supplies.
Francheesqua: Alright. Well I have to go to work, I'll keep an eye out for anything that will help.
You grab some pots.
Renatto: It's time to get cookin'.





